# Local runtime artifacts that shouldn't be tracked.
# `dump.rdb` is Redis's RDB snapshot, `redis.pid` is the daemon PID
# file, `runtime.*.log` are server stdout/stderr captures, and the
# `recover-from-yjs.mjs` / `yjs-pingpong-test.mjs` files are throwaway
# debug scripts that landed in the repo during a debug session.
dump.rdb
servers/rust/redis.pid
servers/rust/runtime.out.log
servers/rust/runtime.err.log
servers/rust/redis.out.log
servers/rust/redis.err.log
apps/web/dev.out.log
apps/web/dev.err.log

# Scribe runtime config — copy of `scribe.config.toml.example`.
# Tracked is fine but most devs keep theirs gitignored.
scribe.config.toml
